description=Automated charging bridge for TECNO POVA 5 Pro 5G (LH8n) on HyperOS. Monitors physical MediaTek/Transsion charging ADCs, detects 68W Ultra Charge, 33W Super Charge, and 18W Fast Charge, and drives HyperIsland and Lockscreen Turbo animations automatically.
